   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "el00000006",
   "originalText": "No authorization model change needed.\nIt's just a migration in the application DB\nwhere that data actually belongs.\nOpenFGA tuples/model stay untouched.",
