   "text": "Solution 1 \u2014 Same hierarchy shape\nDifferent naming convention, or a different\nnumber of nested zone levels.\n\n-> Reuse the existing OpenFGA store + model:\njust add the new client/zones as new objects & tuples.",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "el00000015",
   "originalText": "Solution 1 \u2014 Same hierarchy shape\nDifferent naming convention, or a different\nnumber of nested zone levels.\n\n-> Reuse the existing OpenFGA store + model:\njust add the new client/zones as new objects & tuples.",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "baseline": 12
  },
