   "locked": false,
   "text": "Solution 2 \u2014 Genuinely new hierarchy shape\nA business structure this model doesn't fit at all.\n\n-> Design a new OpenFGA authorization model,\nand give it its own store for that hierarchy type.",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "el00000018",
   "originalText": "Solution 2 \u2014 Genuinely new hierarchy shape\nA business structure this model doesn't fit at all.\n\n-> Design a new OpenFGA authorization model,\nand give it its own store for that hierarchy type.",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "baseline": 12
