   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Audit & logging safety net (see 14-audit-and-logging)\nOpenFGA's own changelog + our audit_events table record every grant/revoke and every zone/structure change \u2014 across all four outcomes above \u2014 so we can always trace what changed, when, and why.",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "el00000022",
   "originalText": "Audit & logging safety net (see 14-audit-and-logging)\nOpenFGA's own changelog + our audit_events table record every grant/revoke and every zone/structure change \u2014 across all four outcomes above \u2014 so we can always trace what changed, when, and why.",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "baseline": 13
  }
